  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "[Help the team feel a sense of belonging](<HBR_What_Does_It_Take_to_Build_a_Culture_of_Belonging>). An essential part of this is to create a culture where every employee, regardless of their background, feels included.\n\nResearch shows that someone belongs at work when they are seen for their unique contributions, connected to their coworkers, supported in their daily work and career development, and proud of their organization's values and purpose. While a lack of belonging is the challenge, especially for people of color, closing belonging gaps will help join employees in a common mission - and retain and engage employees of all backgrounds.",
